      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "80faab83289f6bed",
      "query": "{\"strategic_intent\": \"Inspect the case snapshot, documents, and all three blinded candidate predictions and retrieval logs.\", \"summary\": \"I have read the evaluation instructions, schemas, event.yaml, outcome.json, and statpack.md. The event is a cert-stage petition disposition (scotus/9026000241, evt-petition-disposition, resolved as denied on 2026-11-09). Next, I will read the case context, snapshot, questions presented, and the staged files for codex-baseline, claude-baseline, and gemini-baseline.\", \"tit",
